"><code>register_globals = \"off\"</code>\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br />or "
"within .htaccess:\n"
"\n"
"                                                                        <br /"
"><code>php_flag register_globals off</code>."
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"dashicons dashicons-no\"></span>L'option register_globals est "
"activée. \n"
"                                                                        Pour "
"corriger ce problème de sécurité, modifiez le php.ini :\n"
