msgid ""
"The authenticator app is currently configured. If you reset it, you'll need to "
"re-scan the QR code on all your devices to restore access. Ensure you have the "
"necessary QR code or recovery details ready before proceeding to avoid "
"disruptions to your account security or accessibility."
